The changes made include:

1. Removed all Cal.com specific dependencies
2. Created a self-contained implementation of the UserForm component
3. Implemented basic form components (Select, TextField) without external dependencies
4. Simplified the provider structure to only use I18nextProvider
5. Removed unnecessary providers that were specific to Cal.com
6. Implemented all the form functionality directly in the component
7. Added proper styling using basic CSS classes
8. Kept the same form structure and fields as the original

This should resolve the "require is not defined" error by:
1. Removing all dependencies on Cal.com's library code
2. Using only client-side compatible code
